# Frontend build-time config (Vite exposes only VITE_*-prefixed vars).
# Copy to .env.local for local overrides; .env is gitignored.

# Backend API root. LEAVE UNSET for local dev — the Vite dev server proxies
# /api to http://localhost:8080 (see vite.config.ts). Set it for a deployed
# frontend, which is a separate origin from the backend. No trailing slash.
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://booki-backend.example.run.app/api
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
